Definitions.
- In these rules, unless there is anything repugnant in the subject or context,-
(a)
"Commission" means the Public Service Commission, Uttar Pradesh;
(b)
"Committee" means the Selection Committee referred to in Rule 8 (4);
(c)
"Constitution" means the Constitution of India;
(d)
"Government" means the Government of Uttar Pradesh;
(e)
"Governor" means the Governor of Uttar Pradesh;
(f)
"Inspector General" means the Inspector-General of Prisons, Uttar Pradesh;
(g)
"Post" means the post of Personal Assistant to the Inspector-General of Prisons, Uttar Pradesh;
(h)
"Secretary" means the Secretary, Uttar Pradesh, Home Department (Jails).
